# Frontend

- Use functional components and keep data fetching in `services/` or `hooks/`.
- All inputs need visible labels and associated error text via `aria-describedby`.
- Keep the blue SaaS palette from `frontend/src/index.css`.
- Layouts must work at 320px, 768px, and 1280px without horizontal scroll.
- Interactive controls need a minimum height of 44px (`min-h-11`).
- Authenticated pages read the username from `useAuth()`, never from hard-coded UI text.
